# 📈 Linear Regression Projects

A collection of **Linear Regression projects, experiments, and practice work** created while learning and implementing Machine Learning concepts.

This repository focuses on understanding Linear Regression **from mathematical fundamentals to practical machine learning projects**.

The projects are built using Python and popular Data Science and Machine Learning libraries.

---

## 📚 Concepts Covered

### 🔹 Linear Regression Fundamentals

* Simple Linear Regression
* Multiple Linear Regression
* Ordinary Least Squares (OLS)
* Cost Function
* Coefficients & Intercept
* Model Fitting
* Model Prediction

### 🔹 Data Preparation

* Data Exploration
* Feature & Target Selection
* Train-Test Split
* Feature Scaling
* Standardization using `StandardScaler`

### 🔹 Model Evaluation

* Mean Absolute Error (MAE)
* Mean Squared Error (MSE)
* Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE)
* R² Score
* Adjusted R² Score

### 🔹 Practical Prediction

* Prediction on Test Data
* Prediction on New/Unseen Data
* Regression Line Visualization
* Model Performance Analysis

---

# 🚀 Projects

## 1. 💰 Salary Prediction

A **Simple Linear Regression** project that predicts an employee's salary based on their years of experience.

### Input Feature

```text
YearsExperience
```

### Target

```text
Salary
```

### Concepts Implemented

* Data loading and exploration
* Feature and target selection
* Train-test split
* Feature scaling
* `StandardScaler`
* Linear Regression
* Model training
* Model prediction
* MAE
* MSE
* RMSE
* R² Score
* Adjusted R² Score
* Prediction on new data
* Regression visualization

---

## 2. 🏠 House Price Prediction

A **Simple Linear Regression** project that predicts house prices based on the area of the house.

### Input Feature

```text
