```

### Target

```text
Price
```

### Concepts Implemented

* Data exploration
* Feature and target selection
* Train-test split
* Feature scaling
* Linear Regression
* Model training
* Model evaluation
* Prediction on test data
* Prediction on new house data
* Regression visualization

---

## 3. 🎓 Student Performance Prediction

A **Simple Linear Regression** project that predicts student performance based on Previous score.

### Input Features

```text
PreviousScore
```

### Target

```text
Performance / Exam_Score
```

### Concepts Implemented

* Data exploration
* Feature and target selection
* Train-test split
* Feature scaling
* Linear Regression
* Model training
* Model prediction
* MAE
* MSE
* RMSE
* R² Score
* Prediction on new student data
* Model performance analysis
* Data visualization

